- **Password checklist on the website is now slightly out of step.** The live checklist in `web/src/management/auth/login.tsx` still splits names on spaces only. For a hyphenated or apostrophe name it can show "Not your name or email" as met, then the server refuses the password with that reason. Nothing weak gets accepted. That file is outside H1's approved list, so it needs your go-ahead; the fix is the same one-line change.
