- The two collision-guard warnings are recorded there as well. I re-read `docs/progress.md` and `docs/overnight-log.md` afterwards and found only my own changes in them.

**For you**
- H3 needs you to approve the role matrix before any code, so I stopped there as the overnight order says.
- For deployment, set `NODE_ENV=production`, the real https `CLIENT_ORIGIN`, and the real `TRUST_PROXY` hop count. The proxy must overwrite, not append to, a client-supplied `X-Forwarded-For`.
